commit each specification pins (code from these projects is not copied into this repository unless
listed under third_party/ with its own license):

- inspire-mortality@0: INSPIRE authors' 30-day in-hospital mortality task (gbm_mortality.py); https://github.com/vitaldb/inspire @ 04a249028b9290729a1f8027322bfcc1101739ed
- kor-surgical-robot-voice-command@0: Lee H. Korean Surgical Robot Voice-Command Benchmark (version 1.0.0). Seoul National University Hospital. KHDP. 2026. doi:10.23421/2026.03507 (README, Task and output; Scoring)
- scope-arrest@0: Lee H, Yang HL, Ryu HG, Jung CW, Cho YJ, Yoon SB, Yoon HK, Lee HC. Real-time machine learning model to predict in-hospital cardiac arrest using heart rate variability in ICU. npj Digit Med. 2023;6:215. doi:10.1038/s41746-023-00960-2
- synthetic-snuh-text2sql@0: Lee G, Kweon S, Bae S, Choi E. Overview of the EHRSQL 2024 Shared Task on Reliable Text-to-SQL Modeling on Electronic Health Records. ClinicalNLP @ NAACL 2024. doi:10.18653/v1/2024.clinicalnlp-1.62; https://github.com/glee4810/ehrsql-2024 @ f9e1aa02160d39e3f8df52bf5c69c5cf2e472499
- vitaldb-arrhythmia-abnormal@0: Eun DI, Shim K, Lee H, Lim Y, Lim H, Lee H, Lee J, Lee HC. VitalDB Arrhythmia Database: an anesthesiologist-validated large-scale intraoperative arrhythmia dataset with beat and rhythm labels. Sci Data. 2026;13. doi:10.1038/s41597-026-07076-8 (section Technical Validation); https://github.com/vitaldb/arrdb @ 59b7722674e76592900cb8131d25337f2dd084b8; https://github.com/vitaldb/openecg @ 0d8610fdac1ec2bae25e2f9674d177c124041638

