- third_party/ehrsql-2024: https://github.com/glee4810/ehrsql-2024 @ f9e1aa02160d39e3f8df52bf5c69c5cf2e472499 (CC BY 4.0, the EHRSQL 2024 shared task organisers Gyubok Lee, Sunjun Kweon, Seongsu Bae and Edward Choi): scoring_program/scoring_utils.py, unchanged; its reliability_score and penalize compute every reliability score of synthetic-snuh-text2sql@0 (src/benchtoward/tasks/text2sql_task.py)

